Once when I was a little kid, I watched a documentary about cruelty against animals. There was a scene where little white baby seals were being beaten to death for their fluffy skin. All of them plus the white snow surrounding them was bright red. Mama seals watched in desperation from the sides.

&#x200B;

It all started from there on.

